[
    {
        "id": "tab-hx710a-demo",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "HX710A Scale Demo",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Temperature-monitored load cell demo using the HX710A 24-bit ADC. On deploy, an inject node sends 'tare' to zero the scale. Every 2 seconds a second inject node triggers a weight reading. Every 30 seconds a third inject node sends 'temperature' to sample the on-chip temperature sensor. The HX710A node outputs { raw, weight } for weight readings and { raw_temperature } for temperature readings. The weight debug/gauge nodes show msg.payload.weight; the temperature debug node shows the raw, uncalibrated ADC code. Requires node-red-dashboard for the gauge. Set DOUT and PD_SCK to your GPIO pin numbers and calibrate the scale factor before use."
    },
